{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>75歲老翁杜紹群昨日（22日）晚上7時離開灣仔一間老人院後不知所終，家屬已報警求助，並在網上發文尋人，如任何人發現杜紹群的消息，盡快聯絡警方。</p><p>杜紹群身材高瘦，患有腦退化症，需要定時服藥。最後露面時身穿黑色外套、戴帽、並手持一個裝有報紙的白色布袋。</p><figure><img alt=\"杜紹群最後露面時身穿黑色外套、戴帽、並手持一個裝有報紙的白色布袋。（Elaine Tao Facebook 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189924550377476096283097.jpeg/cpTFrn7tpR6Ys4ccjV4RrYJkp-ZZU6EIDHnEFwx5xBc\"/><figcaption>杜紹群最後露面時身穿黑色外套、戴帽、並手持一個裝有報紙的白色布袋。（Elaine Tao Facebook 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"杜紹群身材高瘦，患有腦退化症，需要定時服藥。（Elaine Tao Facebook 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189924548036923392395840.jpeg/gMzjtuo7_4JXJ0cc4yhIpiS081A4pM0oMAEMLzABDC8\"/><figcaption>杜紹群身材高瘦，患有腦退化症，需要定時服藥。（Elaine Tao Facebook 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"杜紹群身材高瘦，患有腦退化症，需要定時服藥。（Elaine Tao Facebook 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189924545805422592821647.jpeg/3L7zIwinGeGPCewHjpo6KnZ980aRqCqm_U_y4_1P8uM\"/><figcaption>杜紹群身材高瘦，患有腦退化症，需要定時服藥。（Elaine Tao Facebook 圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:21:50.307303+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:06:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:17:55.793308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:40.307651+00:00","content_hash":"03c0b3afa1fb0d323404c6a246a75e8b1d1a42a00ad52472b0afe13cbadc93c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}